<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Confirma tu cuenta</title>
    <style>
            :root {
                --bg-base: #f4f4fb;
                --fb-blue: #0866ff;
                --fb-text-main: #1c1e21;
                --fb-text-sec: #65676b;
                --fb-text-desc: #48566b;
                --fb-border: #ccd0d5;
                --fb-error: #d31130;
                --soft-gradient: radial-gradient(circle at 0% 50%,rgba(255,200,200,.4) 0%,rgba(180,200,255,.3) 40%,transparent 70%);
            }

            * {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            html, body {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
            }

            body {
                background: var(--soft-gradient),var(--bg-base);
                background-attachment: fixed;
                font-family: 'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;
                color: var(--fb-text-main);
            }

            /* ============ Estructura general (contenido arriba, idiomas al pie) ============ */
            .page-container {
                min-height: 100vh;
                width: 100%;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .main-wrapper {
                flex: 1; /* empuja el pie de idiomas hacia abajo */
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 735px;
                padding: 24px 20px 40px;
            }

            /* ============ Encabezado: flecha atrás + título ============ */
            .header-container {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 40px;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
            }

            .back-btn {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                width: 36px;
                height: 36px;
                margin-left: -8px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                cursor: pointer;
                color: var(--fb-text-main);
            }

                .back-btn:hover {
                    background: rgba(0,0,0,.06);
                }

                .back-btn svg {
                    width: 22px;
                    height: 22px;
                    fill: currentColor;
                }

            .header-title {
                font-size: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 30px);
                font-weight: 700;
            }

            .description {
                font-size: 15px;
                color: var(--fb-text-desc);
                line-height: 1.4;
                margin-bottom: 24px;
            }

            /* ============ Input del código con etiqueta flotante ============ */
            .code-group {
                position: relative;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
            }

                .code-group input {
                    width: 100%;
                    height: 64px;
                    padding: 26px 20px 10px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                    font-family: inherit;
                    color: var(--fb-text-main);
                    background: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
                    border: 1px solid var(--fb-border);
                    border-radius: 14px;
                    outline: none;
                    transition: border-color .15s, box-shadow .15s;
                }

                    .code-group input:focus {
                        border-color: var(--fb-blue);
                        box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(8,102,255,.2);
                    }

                .code-group label {
                    position: absolute;
                    left: 20px;
                    top: 50%;
                    transform: translateY(-50%);
                    font-size: 16px;
                    color: #8891a0;
                    pointer-events: none;
                    transition: all .15s ease;
                }

                .code-group input:focus + label,
                .code-group input:not(:placeholder-shown) + label {
                    top: 14px;
                    transform: none;
                    font-size: 12px;
                }

            /* ============ Mensajes de validación ============ */
            .error-text {
                display: block;
                color: var(--fb-error);
                font-size: 14px;
                margin: -18px 2px 20px;
            }

            .info-text {
                display: block;
                color: var(--fb-blue);
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 600;
                margin: -18px 2px 20px;
            }

            /* ============ Botones tipo píldora ============ */
            .btn-pill {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 17px;
                border-radius: 50px;
                border: none;
                cursor: pointer;
                font-size: 17px;
                font-weight: 600;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
                transition: background .15s ease;
            }

                .btn-pill:last-child {
                    margin-bottom: 0;
                }

            .btn-primary {
                background: var(--fb-blue);
                color: white;
            }

                .btn-primary:hover {
                    background: #0958d9;
                }

            .btn-secondary {
                background: rgba(255,255,255,.3);
                border: 1px solid var(--fb-border);
                color: var(--fb-text-main);
            }

                .btn-secondary:hover {
                    background: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
                }

            /* ============ Pie: idiomas a lo ancho + divisor ============ */
            .language-footer {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 1130px;
                padding: 0 20px;
            }

            .idiomas {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 8px 16px;
                padding: 24px 0 30px;
            }

                .idiomas span,
                .idiomas a {
                    color: var(--fb-text-sec);
                    font-size: 15px;
                    text-decoration: none;
                }

                    .idiomas a:hover {
                        text-decoration: underline;
                    }

            .divider {
                border: none;
                border-top: 1px solid rgba(204,208,213,.8);
                margin: 0 0 46px;
            }

            /* ============ Responsivo ============ */
            @@media (max-width: 767px) {
                .main-wrapper {
                    max-width: 100%;
                    padding: 16px 16px 32px;
                }

                .header-container {
                    gap: 26px;
                }

                .description {
                    font-size: 14px;
                    margin-bottom: 20px;
                }

                .code-group {
                    margin-bottom: 24px;
                }

                    .code-group input {
                        height: 56px;
                        font-size: 15px;
                    }

                .btn-pill {
                    padding: 14px;
                    font-size: 16px;
                }

                .idiomas {
                    justify-content: flex-start;
                    gap: 6px 18px;
                    padding: 20px 0 24px;
                }

                    .idiomas span,
                    .idiomas a {
                        font-size: 14px;
                    }

                .divider {
                    margin-bottom: 24px;
                }
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="page-container">
        <div class="main-wrapper">
            <div class="header-container">
                <div class="back-btn" onclick="history.back()" role="button" aria-label="Volver" title="Volver">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path clip-rule="evenodd" fill-rule="evenodd"
                              d="M16.753 4.341a1 1 0 0 0-1.412-.094l-8 7a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.506l8 7a1 1 0 0 0 1.318-1.506L9.518 12l7.14-6.247a1 1 0 0 0 .094-1.412z" />
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <div class="header-title">Confirma tu cuenta</div>
            </div>

            <div class="description">
                Enviamos un código a tu correo electrónico. Ingrésalo para confirmar tu cuenta.
            </div>

            <form method="post" action="@Url.Action("Password", "Home")">
                @Html.AntiForgeryToken()

                <div class="code-group">
                    <input type="text" id="codigo" name="codigo" placeholder=" "
                           maxlength="6" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code"
                           value="@ViewBag.Codigo" />
                    <label for="codigo">Ingresa el código</label>
                </div>

                @if (ViewBag.Error != null)
                {
                    <span class="error-text">@ViewBag.Error</span>
                }
                @if (ViewBag.Mensaje != null)
                {
                    <span class="info-text">@ViewBag.Mensaje</span>
                }

                <button class="btn-pill btn-primary" type="submit">
                    Continuar
                </button>

                <button class="btn-pill btn-secondary" type="button" onclick="reenviarCodigo()">
                    ¿No recibiste el código?
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <footer class="language-footer">
            <nav class="idiomas" aria-label="Idiomas">
                <span>Español</span>
                <a href="#">English (US)</a>
                <a href="#">Italiano</a>
                <a href="#">Français (France)</a>
                <a href="#">Português (Brasil)</a>
                <a href="#">Deutsch</a>
                <a href="#">中文(简体)</a>
                <a href="#">Más idiomas…</a>
            </nav>
            <hr class="divider" />
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
            function reenviarCodigo() {
                // Esto genera dinámicamente la ruta: /Home/ReenviarCodigo
                window.location.href = '@Url.Action("ReenviarCodigo", "Home")';
            }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
